sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant C as BgeAiProductController
  participant I as BgeProductEmbeddingService
  participant P as ProductRepository
  participant Client as BgeEmbeddingClient
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant Model as BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Admin->>C: POST /admin/ai/bge/products/index
  C->>I: indexAllProducts
  I->>P: findAllWithCategoryAndSeller
  P-->>I: Product records
  loop Batches of 32
    I->>I: Build text + SHA-256 hash
    I->>DB: Read existing content hash
    I->>Client: Generate document embeddings for changed items
    Client->>API: POST /v1/embeddings input_type=document
    API->>Model: Encode and normalize
    Model-->>API: 384-dimensional vectors
    API-->>Client: Vector response
    Client-->>I: Validated embeddings
    I->>DB: Upsert product_embeddings_bge
  end
